:"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC sase-s5[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Prevent duplicate digest-suffixed research Highlights PDFs[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Each newly added consolidated research report invokes Bob exactly [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]once from its canonical checkout path, producing only the intended [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]basename while preserving artifact durability and existing [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]file-hook behavior by default.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]file_hook_producer_filter.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/file_hook_producer_filter.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-s5[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-s5/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Add producer-aware file-hook filtering to SASE[/bold #D7AFFF]                [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core-producer-filter[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core-producer-filter: extend the file-hook configuration and dispatch [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]contract with a validated producer filter, document artifact-store path [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]semantics, and cover backward compatibility and dispatch behavior.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Restrict research Highlights generation to committed report [/bold #D7AFFF]  [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]events[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]research-provider-policy[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-producer-filter[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]research-provider-policy: update the sase-research-artifacts provider to[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]exclude artifact-copy events while retaining commit, SDD, and finalizer [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reconciliation paths, with provider-level contract tests and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]documentation.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Verify one canonical Highlights output across the coordinated [bold black on #87D7FF][/bold #D7AFFF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]repositories[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]e2e-verification[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-producer-filter, research-provider-policy[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]e2e-verification: exercise artifact creation, commit dispatch, finalizer[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reconciliation, effective chezmoi configuration, and Bob dry-run naming [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]to prove exactly one canonical output without deleting historical vault [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]files.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-s5","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-s5.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-ae37068622fd26a2fefca371a15c1f0a","started_at":"2026-08-22T17:49:23.924596+00:00","state":"active"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.athena.sase-s5","bbugyi200.athena.sase-s5.1","bbugyi200.athena.sase-s5.2","bbugyi200.athena.sase-s5.3","bbugyi200.athena.sase-s5.land"]}
